# The Name of the Illness
# Dialogic source. Line signals drive the cinematic layout and save checkpoints.
label line_0
[signal arg="line:0:Rin:protected"]
The physician called it a failure of the body.
label line_1
[signal arg="line:1:You:protected"]
There may have been no better name.
label line_2
[signal arg="line:2:Rin:protected"]
There should have been. I have spent years hearing that I am failing.
label line_3
[signal arg="line:3:You:protected"]
You have survived every one of those years.
label line_4
[signal arg="line:4:Rin:protected"]
Then write that down too.
label line_5
[signal arg="line:5:Narrator:protected"]
You turn the page and leave room for a better account.
